Recommends: apparmor
Suggests: docker.io, docker-compose-v2
Description: shared Android devices, scrcpy video, and visible agent cursors
 Android Agent Lab provides a desktop app and browser viewer for shared Android
 devices, with coordinated ADB access for humans and coding agents, continuous
 input, named agent cursors, and developer tools. Docker is optional for the
 included x86_64 Android 16 emulator.
